<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SEPT NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 10 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SEPT NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 10 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New private car registrations increased 10 percent year-on-year in September to 6,762 cars, the Information Centre of the Automobile branch said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>The centre gave the following figures:</p>
<p>								Jan-Sep change</p>
<p>		     Sep '96    1-9 '96    1-9 '95    yr/yr pct</p>
<p>    Private cars  6762	77,729	64,534	+20.4</p>
<p>    Vans	     741	 6,530	 4,855	+34.5</p>
<p>    Lorries	  459	 2,659	 2,272	+17.0</p>
<p>    Buses	     49	   356	  241	 +47.7</p>
<p>    Total	   8,011	87,274     71,902	+21.4</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
</text>
